      "role": "user",
      "content": "i see. so it's about the principle vs the implementation. that's a bit of a grey area if you ask me. how do companies usually draw that line in a dispute? like if they see me using almost the same logic in a different repo, what's the actual threshold that makes them stop seeing it as 'general knowledge' and start seeing it as a violation?",
